      ],
      "source": "https://www.kirklin-mainstreet.org/history.html",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Kirklin sits along Route 421, the historic Michigan Road that once carried travelers north to Zionsville and south to U.S. highways.",
